"""The funder logos, inlined.

Hugging Face refuses a git push containing a binary file that is not tracked
through LFS or Xet, so a PNG committed next to the template never reaches the
Space and the deploy fails. Base64 is text, so it goes through untouched and
there is nothing in the deploy that can reject it.

Each image is scaled to about three times the size it prints at and reduced to
a 128-colour palette, which these flat logos survive without a visible change
and which turns 242 kB of PNG into 40 kB. Regenerate them rather than editing
them by hand: the originals live in the frontend repo under Logos/.
"""

LOGOS = {
    "dsc": "data:image/png;base64,",
    "lse": "data:image/png;base64,",
    "cmcc": "data:image/png;base64,",
    "idalert": "data:image/png;base64,",
    "ukri": "data:image/png;base64,",
}
